      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I assume this would work way better than chairs, right? Because now, if a moving object has chairs in it, avatars stutter A LOT.\n\nEven if it wasn't, though, this is an amazing idea.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
    {
      "__v": 0,
      "_id": "5da66353c0be3b48ceab5ec1",
      "author": {
        "_id": "5b565300b13b3c741470153d",
        "alias": "Gray Lobster",
        "aliasID": "65c321beed6eefce4c470343",
        "anonymized": false,
        "avatarURL": "https://canny.io/images/1618e2f2c96d78b1d49a05fb26913430.png",
