      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is 'technically' with the current state of stations, just really annoying to work with. and IK breaks when facing certain ways. The only issue is that players need to set their avatar to have an empty sitting animation. The solution that you have is much simpler for the user.",
      "viewerReactions": null
